    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but even talking about it feels like another chore. like i'm just performing \"being okay\" for someone else. i look at people and they just seem to have this... fuel. like they're built to keep going. i just don't think i was built for this. i think i've just reached the end of what i can do.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
